    "definition_raw": "Source Adventurer's Guide pg. 124, Arcane Anthology pg. 14\nYou are able to spontaneously cast spells you have mastered more frequently than your peers.\n\nPrerequisites: Magaambyan arcanist spontaneous spell mastery class feature.\n\nBenefit: You gain one additional use of your spontaneous spell mastery ability per day.\n\nSpecial: You can take this feat multiple times.",
